% SUSY-2013-13 fig_01b: slepton pair, slepton -> l neutralino1, neutralino1 -> l l nu via RPV lambda
layout: v2
arrows: none
in: p1 p2
out: l1 a1 a2 a3 b1 b2 b3 l2
